2. `removeCourse(const std::string& courseName)`: Removes a course from the registrar's records.
3. `registerStudent(const std::string& studentName, const std::string& courseName)`: Registers a student for a specific course.
4. `unregisterStudent(const std::string& studentName, const std::string& courseName)`: Unregisters a student from a specific course.
5. `listCourses(const std::string& studentName)`: Lists all the courses a student is registered for.

