You are tasked with implementing a priority queue data structure that supports the enqueue operation with a specified priority level. The priority queue should allow multiple items with the same priority level and ensure that items are dequeued in the order of their priority. You are given a code snippet that represents a test case for the enqueue operation of the priority queue.

